WEBVTT

00:29:28.746 --> 00:29:33.329
it's sort of we've retreated to the things
that humans could uniquely do,

00:29:33.329 --> 00:29:35.371
think better, be more creative
and so forth.

00:29:35.621 --> 00:29:39.496
I guess the worry about A.I. is that
in principle, I believe this,

00:29:39.954 --> 00:29:48.246
that there is no human cognitive feat
that won't ultimately be doable,

00:29:48.454 --> 00:29:50.913
probably better by artificial
general touch,

00:29:50.913 --> 00:29:55.413
simply because of the extra firepower
that ultimately they can have,

00:29:55.413 --> 00:29:59.663
the vast knowledge they bring
to the table and so forth.

00:29:59.954 --> 00:30:05.454
Is that basically right, that there is
ultimately no safe sort of space where